# Files excluded from the Vercel deployment bundle.
#
# The source-asset folders hold Noni's original dish cut-outs plus the generated dish
# renders (~340MB of PNGs). They are build-time inputs to `npm run images:prep` and
# `npm run images:generated`, which write the optimized JPEGs into public/images/photos —
# those are what the site serves. The sources must never be deployed: anything under
# public/ is publicly downloadable, and these would only bloat the bundle.
#
# Kept in sync with .gitignore.
/gemini-watermark-cleaned/
/specialty-pizzas/
/walk-in-special/
/panzerotti/
/pizza-deals/
/pizza-wings-combos/
/chicken-wings/
/indian-fusion-pizza-sides/
/nonipizza_photos/

# Docs — not needed at runtime.
CLAUDE.md
DESIGN.md
CONVERSATION.md
CREDITS.md
IMAGE-MANIFEST.md
